I sequenced a 60 bp amplified region and want to know whether it matches my reference. Align the read against the reference and tell me the identity percentage, how many differences there are, and where the first mismatch is.

Reference (200 bp):
{seq:align_reference}

Read (60 bp), which is reference positions 51-110 with one base changed:
{seq:align_read}

Design one qPCR primer pair on this 400 bp template. I want an amplicon between 80 and 150 bp, primer Tm between 58 and 62 degrees, and I only need the best candidate. Give me both primer sequences, their positions, and the amplicon size.

Template:
{template:400:7}

I have three FASTQ reads and I am worried about the quality of the last one. Run read-level QC and tell me: the mean per-base quality, the Q30 percentage, and whether any read has a quality collapse towards its 3' end.

Reads:
{seq:qc_reads}
